oject","title":"Ruparel Mumbai XL, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹2.00 Cr Onwards | 2 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Ruparel developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/ruparel-598.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Ruparel Mumbai XL Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-amenities-features4.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.00 Cr - 2.30 Cr**\n\n₹34,600 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Ruparel Mumbai XL?\n\n## About Ruparel Mumbai XL, Kandivali West by Ruparel\n\nOffering 2 and 4 2+2 BHKs at Kandivali West, Ruparel Realty Mumbai XL offers world class amenities along with pinned site luxuryWith luxurious amenities and highend technologies, you can fulfil your dream of spacious apartments with zero wastage Erected in one of the prime locations, Ruparel Realty Mumbai XL brings an efficient layout and world class finishes inside your home\n\n## Ruparel Mumbai XL Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Ruparel Mumbai XL.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  620 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.00 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  650 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.10 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  710 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.30 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRuparel Mumbai XL's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Ruparel Mumbai XL | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 34600 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 34650 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 30600 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 30600 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nRuparel Mumbai XL avg. price is ₹ 34.6 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Chandak Greenairy](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/chandak-greenairy/152458/project \"Chandak Greenairy\") | ₹ 37,100 |\n| Current Project **Ruparel Mumbai XL** | ₹ 34,600 |\n| [Godrej Bliss Kandivali](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-bliss-kandivali/224121/project \"Godrej Bliss Kandivali\") | ₹ 29,100 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-sarova/10427/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova\") | ₹ 26,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Kandivali West ranges from ₹ 24.2 K to ₹ 75.6 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Ruparel Mumbai XL | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Ruparel Mumbai XL.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Ruparel Mumbai XL moved from ₹ 30,600/sqft to ₹ 34,650/sqft, reflecting a 13.24% rise.\n\nA total of 224 out of 390 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 60% of 2 BHK(224 out of 374 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 57% completion, Internal finishing stands at 10%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 10% done.\n\nA total of 224 out of 390 launched units have been booked as of July 2024, including 60% of 2 BHK(224 out of 374 units).\n\nA total of 39 out of 387 launched units have been booked as of June 2022, including 10% of 2 BHK(39 out of 378 units).\n\nRuparel Westsky, developed by RUPAREL SHREEJI CONSTRUCTION PVT LTD, officially launched on 17-Aug-2017 and expected to complete by 31-Dec-2027. Registered under RERA No. P51800007630. with total area of 0.78 Acre.\n\n## Ruparel Mumbai XL Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 620 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Ruparel Mumbai XL, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/ruparel-mumbai-xl-apartment-2-bhk-620sqft-20223307153343-3d-3968.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.00 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 650 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Ruparel Mumbai XL, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/ruparel-mumbai-xl-apartment-2-bhk-650sqft-20223407153417-3d-3906.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.10 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 710 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Ruparel Mumbai XL, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.30 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Ruparel Mumbai XL\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Ruparel Mumbai XL to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-amenities-features4.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload brochure & master plan of Ruparel Mumbai XL to explore floor plans and layout details in Kandivali West, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Expert Review\n\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL Sample Flat Walkthrough | Kandivali West](https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ke7_4qQjyEg/hqdefault.jpg)\n![Mumbai XL (Ruparel Realty) - Kandivali West, Mumbai]