e with similar projects?\n\n![Ruparel Mumbai XL project in Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-mumbai-xl-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Ruparel Mumbai XL](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-mumbai-xl/111437/project \"Ruparel Mumbai XL\")\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shapoorji-pallonji-kandivali-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-sarova/10427/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shapoorji Pallonji Siennaa project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shapoorji-pallonji-sienna-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Shapoorji Pallonji Siennaa](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-siennaa/10466/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Siennaa\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Ruparel Mumbai XL Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Ruparel Mumbai XL located at Kandivali West Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nI would say that this project is one of the best projects in Kandivali West. This 59-storey building provides unmatched vistas and luxurious amenities.\n\nOwner\n\nInvesting in this project is promising given its placement and developer's history.\n\nOwner\n\nAmenities such as the rooftop jacuzzi and landscaped gardens provide a touch of luxury.\n\nOwner\n\nIts proximity to Kandivali Station and proposed metro lines further increases its appeal.\n\nOwner\n\nI think buyers should keep track of the construction updates from the developer.\n\n## Ruparel Track Record\n\n![Ruparel logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/ruparel-598.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nFounded in 2000 under the leadership of Mr Mahendra Ruparel, Ruparel Realty is one of Mumbai's top real estate companies. The company is well-known for developing affordable and luxurious residential properties that promise quality living to its residents.\nWith over 2 million square feet of projects delivered and more than 6 million square feet of projects under delivery, Ruparel Realty aims to create iconic living experiences. It primarily operates in Mumbai and has developed properties in Dadar East, Parel, Kurla, Chembur, Kandivali West, and Santacruz West. \nThe company follows a strict no-compromise policy and does not compromise on the quality of projects. It works with nearly 400 professionals, including reputed engineers and architects, who design and develop superior-quality buildings using high-quality construction materials. \nFor its unwavering commitment to innovation, excellence, and customer satisfaction, Ruparel Realty has won numerous awards. For example, Ruparel Optima won the Best Affordable Housing Project at Hindustan Times Award. In addition, the managing director of the company, Mr Amit Ruparel, was also awarded the Most Promising Developer Award by MidDay Gaurav Icons Awards. \nThe company is committed to customer satisfaction. It promises its customers well-located residential spaces, premium amenities, efficient and aesthetically appealing spaces, minimum lifelong cost of ownership, and complete delivery assurance. It also promises low maintenance costs, great investment benefits, and maximum rental yields. \nWith a strong focus on quality, integrity, and meeting customer needs, Ruparel Realty continues to make a significant impact in the real estate industry.\n\n![Ruparel Arista residential project in Mulund West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-arista-project-flagship-opt-de82f4e7-23fc-4204-809f-b4907ab9fe04.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMulund West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 3.25 Cr\n\n![Ruparel Zinnia residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-zinnia-project-flagship-opt-57e4af75-7c0f-46a9-be96-ae901cbf5ca7.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.46 Cr to 1.92 Cr\n\n![Ruparel Urbana residential project in Kurla](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-urbana-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKurla, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 99.00 Lac to 1.59 Cr\n\n![Ruparel Premia residential project in Mulund West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-premia-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMulund West, Mumbai\n\n1, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.21 Cr to 2.42 Cr\n\n![Ruparel Pristine residential project in Ghatkopar East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-pristine-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGhatkopar East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 1.45 Cr to 3.55 Cr\n\n![Ruparel Stardom residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-stardom-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.50 Cr to 4.12 Cr\n\n![Ruparel Celestia residential project in Mulund East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-celestia-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMulund East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.25 Cr to 2.41 Cr\n\n![Ruparel Crest residential project in Kurla East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ruparel-crest-project-flag