ebp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-unit-flat-no-1.webp)![Ruparel Elara](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/18046/18046-oth-ruparel-elara-unit-flat-no-2-3.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nRuparel Elara is located in the heart of Kandivali west and is developed by Ruparel Realty. Highlights of Ruparel Elara: A Marvellous 22 Storeyed High-Rise Tower Conveniently Located at Kandivali West Offering 1 BHK Enriched Lifestyle Homes Smartly Planned Living Spaces with World-Class Fixtures & Fitments Elegant Lifestyle Amenities on Terrace Level Ruparel Elara was launched in Oct 2014 and the possession of the same is likely to be in Dec 2019. Stack Car Parking Space Ruparel Elara is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing P51800014328. Ruparel Realty also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Shanti Aashish, The Ridge, Sea Winds, Ruparel Orion, Ruparel Ariana, Ruparel Iris, Ruparel Sea Palace, Ruparel Mirage, Ruparel Sky Greens, Ruparel Jewel, Codename West Park, Ruparel Elara , Ruparel Elavia, Ruparel Regalia, Ruparel Optima, Ruparel Palacio, Ruparel Sky Greens, Ruparel Nova, Ruparel Pride. The property prices in Kandivali West are in the range of 13000 to 17500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects. Ruparel Realty currently has 6 Under Construction projects. Ruparel Elara has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 4 out of 5.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹32,407\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹40,000**\n\n19% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹32,407/sqft** — **28% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Time