# RERA Registered Projects in Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Ruparel Sky Greens-Image](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2018/06/01/Project-Photo-29-Ruparel-Sky-Greens-Mumbai-5092248_345_1366_240_0.jpg \"Ruparel Sky Greens-Image\")\n\n**Ruparel Sky Greens**\n\nin [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#)\n, Mumbai\n\nby Ruparel Realty\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Overview Ruparel Sky Greens at Kandivali West, Mumbai, offers high-end yet affordable apartment options ranging between INR 1.0 Cr. - 1.10 Cr.. Ruparel Sky Greens in Kandivali West Mumbai offers 3 striking towers of 40 storeys each overlooking glorious views of the city skyline. Rise above the ordinary to experience an extraordinary lifestyle in these magnificent towers featuring 440 units.   About the Project   Ruparel Sky Greens is an iconic project 1BHK and 2BHK fully automated residential apartments boasting world class facilities. This project is a gated community featuring 4 tier security and round the clock CCTV surveillance. There are an array of exquisite leisure and recreational facilities that gives the residents an opportunity to enjoy all the best things that this project and as such life has to offer. Some of these astounding facilities on the podium level include clubhouse, swimming pool, fitness center, pool side café, spa with steam and sauna, virtual gaming zone, jogging track, kids play area, yoga and meditation area. Ruparel Sky Greens promotes a healthier lifestyle with its green landscaped spaces, solar power lighting, thermal insulation, rainwater harvesting and waste water recycling mechanism.   Ruparel Sky Greens also enjoys an excellent location as it is minutes away from Kandivali Railway Station, Western Express Highway, SV Road, Mangal Murthi Hospital, Ryan International School and Infinity Mall.   Highpoints   These towers in Ruparel Sky Greens inspire you to reach for the stars as it specializes in offering one-of-its-kind sky lifestyle with facilities such as sky cafeteria, sky lounges, sky observatory, sky garden, vertical garden and even automated car parking space situated on the 15th floor. The residential apartments in this project feature home automation system too. Resplendent in every manner, these ultra-modern homes transform dreams into reality with their effervescent features. To celebrate life’s precious moments in style and luxury, book your apartment today. Ruparel Sky Greens Kandivali West MumbaiKey Facts & USPs  | Feature | Details | | --- | --- | | Project Key USPs | 3 towers with G+42 floors, premium 1 BHK and 2 BHK residences, first-of-its-kind sky lifestyle fully-automated homes, sky garden, clubhouse, gym, yoga & meditation zone | | Structure Details | 3 towers, each G+42 floors, construction type not explicitly mentioned but high-rise residential towers | | Location Advantages | Close proximity to metro station, railway station, schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and major roads | |\n\nOverview  \nRuparel Sky Greens at Kandivali West, Mumbai, offers high-end yet affordable apartment options ranging between INR 1.0 Cr. - 1.10 Cr.. Ruparel Sky Greens in Kandivali West Mumbai offers 3 striking towers of 40 storeys each overlooking glorious views of the city skyline. Rise above the ordinary to experience an extraordinary lifestyle in these magnificent towers featuring 440 units.  \n   \nAbout the Project  \n   \nRuparel Sky Greens is an iconic project 1BHK and 2BHK fully automated residential apartments boasting world class facilities. This project is a gated community featuring 4 tier security and round the clock CCTV surveillance. There are an array of exquisite leisure and recreational facilities that gives the residents an opportunity to enjoy all the best things that this project and as such life has to offer. Some of these astounding facilities on the podium level include clubhouse, swimming pool, fitness center, pool side café, spa with steam and sauna, virtual gaming zone, jogging track, kids play area, yoga and meditation area. Ruparel Sky Greens promotes a healthier lifestyle with its green landscaped spaces, solar power lighting, thermal insulation, rainwater harvesting and waste water recycling mechanism.  \n   \nRuparel Sky Greens also enjoys an excellent location as it is minutes away from Kandivali Railway Station, Western Express Highway, SV Road, Mangal Murthi Hospital, Ryan International School and Infinity Mall.  \n   \nHighpoints  \n   \nThese towers in Ruparel Sky Greens inspire you to reach for the stars as it specializes in offering one-of-its-kind sky lifestyle with facilities such as sky cafeteria, sky lounges, sky observatory, sky garden, vertical garden and even automated car parking space situated on the 15th floor. The residential apartments in this project feature home automation system too. Resplendent in every manner, these ultra-modern homes transform dreams into reality with their effervescent features. To celebrate life’s precious moments in style and luxury, book your apartment today.\n\n## Ruparel Sky Greens Kandivali West Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | 3 towers with G+42 floors, premium 1 BHK and 2 BHK residences, first-of-its-kind sky lifestyle fully-automated homes, sky garden, clubhouse, gym, yoga & meditation zone |\n| Structure Details | 3 towers, each G+42 floors, construction type not explicitly mentioned but high-rise residential towers |\n| Location Advantages | Close proximity to metro station, railway station, schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and major roads |\n\n![Acme Avenue-Image](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/Project-Photo-37-Acme-Avenue-Mumbai-5024118_345_1366_240_0.jpg \"Acme Avenue-Image\")\n\n**Acme Avenue**\n\nin [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#)\n, Mumbai\n\nby Acme Group\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Acme Avenue in Kandivali West, Mumbai has amazing luxury flats available from INR 1.35 Cr to 1.90 Cr. Acme Avenue is an exclusive gated community taking shape in one of the 'most sought AFTER' residential destination of Charkop, Kandivali- West. High- rise magnificent towers, rising above everything else and presenting a life of a higher order. Replete with space, luxury, lifestyle and state-of-the-art technology. Acme Avenue redefines the concept of future living. This is a RERA registered project with registration number P51800002030. Acme Avenue Kandivali West MumbaiKey Facts & USPs  | Feature | Details | | --- | --- | | Project Key USPs | Elegant project by Acme Group, partially ready to move, well connected by major roads like Swami Vivekanand Road, New Link Road, Western Express Highway | | Location Advantages | Located in Kandivali West, Mumbai Western Suburbs; well connected to major roads and business districts; proximity to healthcare, educational institutions, and shopping complexes | |\n\nAcme Avenue in Kandivali West, Mumbai has amazing luxury flats available from INR 1.35 Cr to 1.90 Cr. Acme Avenue is an exclusive gated community taking shape in one of the 'most sought AFTER' residential destination of Charkop, Kandivali- West. High- rise magnificent towers, rising above everything else and presenting a life of a higher order. Replete with space, luxury, lifestyle and state-of-the-art technology. Acme Avenue redefines the concept of future living. This is a RERA registered project with registration number P51800002030.\n\n## Acme Avenue Kandivali West Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Elegant project by Acme Group, partially ready to move, well connected by major roads like Swami Vivekanand Road, New Link Road, Western Express Highway |\n| Location Advantages | Located in Kandivali West, Mumbai Western Suburbs; well connected to major roads and business districts; proximity to healthcare, educational institutions, and shopping complexes |\n\n![Ruparel Elara-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png \"Ruparel Elara-Image\")\n\n**Ruparel Elara**\n\nin [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#)\n, Mumbai\n\nby Ruparel Realty\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Ruparel Elara is a fabulously designed 22 storey towering structure offering 1BHK upscale apartments and is centrally situated in Kandivali West. The 1BHK apartments are sized at 410 sqft and 675 sqft and are priced within the range of Rs60 lakhs and Rs85 lakhs.    Project Details    Ruparel Elara is a magnificently designed residential project by Ruparel Realty in Kandivali. It is designed to offer an upscale lifestyle to those looking for a small yet spacious accommodation. Exuding class and sophistication, these smartly designed homes boast premium fittings and fixtures. Each of the apartments contain video door phone system to ensure complete privacy and security of the space.    The apartments in Ruparel Elara is worth the investment as they provide an impeccable lifestyle and an opportunity to enjoy finer things in life. Accompanying the gloriously designed residential apartments are a selection of amenities such as high-tech gym, terrace garden and an exclusive area for senior citizens to sit outdoors. Besides, these there is also an indoor games area with provision to play table tennis, carom, snooker and board games.    The best part about Ruparel Elara is the round the clock CCTV surveillance along with gated security ensuring complete security at all times.    Highpoints    One of the unique highpoints of Ruparel Elara is the presence of stacked car parking space where cars can be parked at multi level thereby saving on space. For those desiring a high-end lifestyle with best in class amenities should definitely invest in this RERA certified project that leaves no stone unturned in offering the best. The location is also quite prominent enjoying proximity to restaurants, multiplexes, schools and colleges. Western Express Highway is only 10 minutes away while Kandivali Railway Station is a short 6 minutes away. Book now in Ruparel Elara to discover the experience of residing in a premium and lavish accommodation. Ruparel Elara Kandivali West MumbaiKey Facts & USPs  | Feature | Details | | --- | --- | | Project Key USPs | Well developed 1 BHK flats with carpet area 425-431 sq.ft, privacy and exclusivity, eco-friendly residing, world-class services, video-door phone in each apartment | | Structure Details | Vitrified flooring, POP finished walls, modular kitchen with branded fittings, anti-skid tiled bathrooms with branded sanitary ware | | Electrical Systems | 24Hrs backup electricity, video-door phone, intercom, CCTV monitoring | | Location Advantages | Located in Kandivali West, well connected by road and rail, proximity to shopping malls, hospitals, schools, and business districts | |\n\nRuparel Elara is a fabulously designed 22 storey towering structure offering 1BHK upscale apartments and is centrally situated in Kandivali West. The 1BHK apartments are sized at 410 sqft and 675 sqft and are priced within the range of Rs60 lakhs and Rs85 lakhs.\n\nProject Details\n\nRuparel Elara is a magnificently designed residential project by Ruparel Realty in Kandivali. It is designed to offer an upscale lifestyle to those looking for a small yet spacious accommodation. Exuding class and sophistication, these smartly designed homes boast premium fittings and fixtures. Each of the apartments contain video door phone system to ensure complete privacy and security of the space.\n\nThe apartments in Ruparel Elara is worth the investment as they provide an impeccable lifestyle and an opportunity to enjoy finer things in life. Accompanying the gloriously designed residential apartments are a selection of amenities such as high-tech gym, terrace garden and an exclusive area for senior citizens to sit outdoors. Besides, these there is also an indoor games area with provision to play table tennis, carom, snooker and board games.\n\nThe best part about Ruparel Elara is the round the clock CCTV surveillance along with gated security ensuring complete security at all times.\n\nHighpoints\n\nOne of the unique highpoints of Ruparel Elara is the presence of stacked car parking space where cars can be parked at multi level thereby saving on space. For those desiring a high-end lifestyle with best in class amenities should definitely invest in this RERA certified project that leaves no stone unturned in offering the best. The location is also quite prominent enjoying proximity to restaurants, multiplexes, schools and colleges. Western Express Highway is only 10 minutes away while Kandivali Railway Station is a short 6 minutes away. Book now in Ruparel Elara to discover the experience of residing in a premium and lavish accommodation.\n\n## Ruparel Elara Kandivali West Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Well developed 1 BHK flats with carpet area 425-431 sq.ft, privacy and exclusivity, eco-friendly residing, world-class services, video-door phone in each apartment |\n| Structure Details | Vitrified flooring, POP finished walls, modular kitchen with branded fittings, anti-skid tiled bathrooms with branded sanitary ware |\n| Electrical Systems | 24Hrs backup electricity, video-door phone, intercom, CCTV monitoring |\n| Location Advantages | Located in Kandivali West, well connected by road and rail, proximity to shopping malls, hospitals, schools, and business districts |\n\n![Gauri Excellency-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png \"Gauri Excellency-Image\")\n\n**Gauri Excellency**\n\nin [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumb