od quality CP fittings with hot and cold water provision, premium sanitary ware fittings, granite kitchen platform with cabinets, and concealed electrical wiring with decorative modular switches.  \n  \nSkylon Spaces Mumbai features many modern amenities and facilities for its residents like double height entrance lobby, ample car parking space, 24 hour security facility with CCTV surveillance, power back up, water supply, lifts, children’s play area, park, fire fighting systems, card swipe security elevator & key utility areas system etc. to name a few.   \n  \n  \nHighpoints:  \n  \nSkylon Spaces is a high rise residential project located in the happening suburb of Mumbai, providing an exquisite and extraordinary lifestyle. The residents can enjoy the serene view and a still life away from the hustle of the main locality. Skylon Spaces Mumbai locality includes utilities like Rameshwar Bank Bus Stop, Kandivali Railway Station, Evershine Mall, Uttkarsh Vidya Mandir, Ankur Hospital, IDBI Bank, D Mart etc.\n\n## Skylon Spaces Kandivali West Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Luxurious towers with elegant landscape, positive energy, ultimate comfort, and priority on safety & security |\n| Structure Details | Residential tower construction, RCC structure (implied by RCC consultant involvement) |\n| Electrical Systems | Provision for cable TV & Internet connection, power backup for elevators, integrated security system with card swipe |\n| Location Advantages | Located in Kandivali West, affluent society proximity, good social infrastructure |\n\n![Shreeji Aikyam-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png \"Shreeji Aikyam-Image\")\n\n**Shreeji Aikyam**\n\nin [Kandivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Kandivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#)\n, Mumbai\n\nby Shreeji Sharan Group of Companies\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Shree Aikyam is an